  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AACCSA/ECCSA, PSD Hub, Phase II - PSD Hub Phase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AACCSA/ECCSA, PSD Hub, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building to the privat sector through AACCA, the chamber of  commerce and sectorial associations in Addis Ababa, the overall       objective is to build capacity of AACCSA to operate and serve as an   efficient business membership organsation, and act as a voice on      behalf of the private sector in its policy dialogue with the          government. The support includes studies and projects aiming at refor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till privatsektorutveckling genom handelskammaren i Addis Abeba, Kapacitetsutveckling. Overgripande m&#xe5;l att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos     handelskammren f&#xf6;r att effektivt fungera och serva sina medlemmar     inkl. att agera som spr&#xe5;kr&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r privatsektorn i policydialogen med   regeringen. St&#xf6;det inneh&#xe5;ller studier, projekt som syftar till        systemf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar inom regelverket och p&#xe5; institutionsniv&#xe5;</narrative>
  </description>
